---
description: Recover and organize local browser references and leave a verified handoff in the current collection.
args:
  goal: string
returns: PersonalArtifactsReport
budget: { maxTurns: 14 }
---
Resolve the requested reference and collection work through the relevant domain lambdas. Use maintainLibrary when the goal needs bookmark or visit facts. Use arrangeCollection when the goal needs a panel change or panel facts; a failed library precondition alone does not require reading untouched panels.

Return the application disposition: changed with the actual results of domains that changed, held with native snapshot-grounded reasons when a prerequisite prevents all work, or unchanged with the relevant verified domain results. Include any held sub-operation alongside completed changes. Do not manufacture untouched domain snapshots. A different-urls hold returns the two actual bookmark records as left and right; a tied-latest-visits hold returns the requested reference and actual tied URLs. The library observation used to make that decision stays internal. Follow the user's requested independent fallback work even when linking is held.
